# 8. REFINEMENT DATA
_refine_special_details
; Carbon and Nitrogen atoms were refined isotropically due to the 
  heavily disordered nature of the cations. The C-C and the C-N
  bond distances and the C-N-C, N-C-N and C-C-N bond angles were 
  restrained to 1.42(1) Angstrom and 108.00(1) degrees, respectively. 
  The thermal parameters of the IM molecules were restrained so that 
  each cation has the same Uiso.
;
